Third-party model outputs
Parts of data/ and results/ are text generated by third-party models:
- data/ (tasks, character dialogues, synthetic cheat/honest pairs, spillover
  items), the spillover judge scores and the neuron descriptions were generated
  by anthropic/claude-haiku-5.5 via OpenRouter.
- results/monitor_verdicts.jsonl contains verdicts from openai/gpt-6-luna and
  google/gemini-3.5-flash-lite via OpenRouter.
- Episode excerpts are outputs of LoRA fine-tunes of Qwen3-8B (Apache-2.0).
Those providers' terms of use may restrict some downstream uses of their
outputs (for example, training competing models). Check them before reuse.
